                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Book of Desires is a decent hidden-object adventure with a dark fairy-tale atmosphere. I enjoyed the mysterious story and exploring the strange locations while trying to uncover the secrets behind the book.\r\n\r\nThe story is intriguing, although it can become confusing, and some of the puzzles feel either too easy or unnecessarily unclear. There is also some backtracking that slows the pace down.\r\n\r\nI'd recommend it mainly to players who enjoy older-style hidden-object adventures.\r\n\r\nEnjoy :)",
